  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MyRight(/Shia) Info 2012-2013 - MyRight (Shia) info 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MyRight(/Shia) Info 2012-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A two-year information campagin with a numer of member orgs aiming to increase knowledge about the importance of education for people with  disabilitites in terms of combating poverty, as well as to raising    awareness about the fact that people with disabilities frequently see their right to education unrealised. The Swedish public is the target group.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En informationskampanj under 2 &#xe5;r med ett antal MOs som syftar till   att &#xf6;ka kunskapen om betydelsen av utbildning f&#xf6;r personer med        funktionsneds&#xe4;ttning i arbetet mot fattigdom liksom medvetenheten om  att personer med funktionsneds&#xe4;ttning ofta inte har de r&#xe4;ttigheter    till utbildning som de borde ha. Svenska allm&#xe4;nheten &#xe4;r m&#xe5;lgruppen.</narrative>
  </description>
